Package: greenwood
Title: Modern Survival Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Richard", "Iannone", , "riannone@me.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3925-190X"))
Description: Survival analysis with a response model shared with the Python
    package of the same name. 'Surv' objects follow the 'survival' package, so
    both languages accept the same inputs and give the same results.
